# EXTRACT of mob-move-head-is-120px-above-the-mobs-real-feet-world.log (348901 lines, 79446991 bytes).
# The full log stays on Wisp's machine and is gitignored: 136 MB of whole world logs
# does not belong in git history, and this repo already uses the -extract convention.
# Kept here: the file header, then the first 4000 CONSECUTIVE 0x02FF mob-move reports,
# which is what crate::dropsite's measurement rests on - the head of report N+1 equals the
# LAST path element of report N. Consecutive pairs are preserved, so the identity is
# re-derivable from this file alone with tools/mobmove_lag.py.
maplecw-world: revive: 426 maps have a respawn destination
maplecw-world: footholds: 94089 segments across 426 maps (62869 floors, 31220 walls which are never landed on)
